Name:P22 - Life from the Loam with lands in the graveyard is never a failed cast (round 1050, P3-40)
Description:Stock Flat MC's ParadoxOutcome.sureCast took any ChangeZone-to-hand spell whose ValidTgts says YouCtrl for a Paradoxical Outcome, set the AI's four nonland permanents as its targets and offered it without a legality check. Life from the Loam (Origin Graveyard) could never be cast that way, and PhaseHandler asked the AI again up to 999 times a priority (P3-40, logs-1119: 11 times in one Gitrog match, about 25 minutes on a phone). Round 1050: only battlefield bounces, legal targets only; failed casts leave the AI's play list. Expect: no AI play is chosen and then fails. Lands in the graveyard.
